# Planner differences xqt planner expects (zig build check passes this
# file with --known). One per line: CASEFILE KIND QUERY, the query as in
# the case file. A listed query that agrees again fails the run (FIXED),
# so that the line goes.
#
# sqlite3 3.54.1 runs a multi-row VALUES as a co-routine ("SCAN 3-ROW
# VALUES CLAUSE"); xqlite still emits one ResultRow per row.
eqp_select.txt code VALUES(1),(2),(3)
eqp_select.txt eqp VALUES(1),(2),(3)
